    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol.">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIAtr">III Atr</ref> Prol.</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðis syndon þa lága þe Æðelred cyng ⁊ his witan gerædd habbað æt Wánetingc to friðes bóte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">These are the constitutions which King Æthelred and his councillors have enacted at Wantage for the promotion of public security.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Hę sunt leges, quas Æþelredus rex et sapientes sui constituerunt apud Wanetingum ad emendationem pacis et felicitatis incrementum.</ab>
      </div>
